    "created_at": "2023-04-20T22:23:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-20T22:23:50Z",
    "body": "I wonder if whatever solution is devised (eg: `:focusable`) would link up with `delegatesFocus`.  In other words, non-FACE that use `delegatesFocus` should probably get the same \"interactive content\" treatment.\r\n\r\nSide note: `delegatesFocus` + `:disabled` + FACE has some vagueness that can be clarified. Firefox recently fixed a [bug](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1818287) related to events not firing. Something clearer in spec could be useful.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
