    "created_at": "2023-04-21T11:00:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-21T11:00:21Z",
    "body": "[WCCG had their spring F2F](https://github.com/WICG/webcomponents/issues/978#issuecomment-1516897276) in which this was discussed. You can read the full notes of the discussion (https://github.com/WICG/webcomponents/issues/978#issuecomment-1516897276), heading entitled \"Enhancements to Form-Associated Custom Elements\".\r\n\r\nThe discussion concluded with present members of WCCG feeling as though FACEs should be labellable (and already are, per-spec), but interactivity will need changes to specification.",
